:"tulafono?"}]},{"en":"For the name of God is blasphemed among the Gentiles through you, as it is written.","n":24,"sm":"aua ua upuleagaina le suafa o le Atua talu outou i nuu ese, faapei ona tusia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"upuleagaina"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"suafa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"talu"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ese,"},{"en":"","sm":"faapei"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tusia."}]},{"en":"For circumcision verily profiteth, if thou keep the law: but if thou be a breaker of the law, thy circumcision is made uncircumcision.","n":25,"sm":"Auā e aoga le peritome, pe afai e te anaana i le tulafono; a e afai e te soli i le tulafono, ua avea ai lou peritome ma faaleperitomeina.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Auā"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aoga"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"peritome,"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"anaana"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tulafono;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"soli"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tulafono,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"avea"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"peritome"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"faaleperitomeina."}]},{"en":"Therefore if the uncircumcision keep the righteousness of the law, shall not his uncircumcision be counted for circumcision?","n":26,"sm":"O lenei, afai e tausia e le le peritome upu tonu o le tulafono, e le ta‘uperitomeina ea lona le peritome?","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei,"},{"en":"","sm":"afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tausia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"peritome"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"tonu"},{"en":"","sm":"o